hadiths[count]{hadithnumber,text}:
"1028.1","Yahya related to me from Malik from Amr ibn al-Harith from Ubayd ibn Fayruz from al-Bara ibn Azib that the Messenger of Allah"
"1028.2","Yahya related to me from Malik from Amr ibn al-Harith from Ubayd ibn Fayruz from al-Bara ibn Azib that the Messenger of Allah"
"1029.1","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that Abdullah ibn Umar would guard against animals and camels which were young or had physical defects as sacrifices. Malik said"
"1029.2","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that Abdullah ibn Umar would guard against animals and camels which were young or had physical defects as sacrifices. Malik said"
"1030.1","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that one time Abdullah ibn Umar wanted to sacrifice an animal at Madina. Nafi said"
"1030.2","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that one time Abdullah ibn Umar wanted to sacrifice an animal at Madina. Nafi said"
"1031.1","ahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said from Bushayr ibn Yasar that Abu Burda ibn Niyar sacrificed an animal before the Messenger of Allah"
"1031.2","ahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said from Bushayr ibn Yasar that Abu Burda ibn Niyar sacrificed an animal before the Messenger of Allah"
"1032.1","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said from Abbad ibn Tamin that one time Uwaymir ibn Ashqar sacrificed his animal before the prayer on the morning of the Day of Sacrifice"
"1032.2","Yahya related to me from Malik from Yahya ibn Said from Abbad ibn Tamin that one time Uwaymir ibn Ashqar sacrificed his animal before the prayer on the morning of the Day of Sacrifice"
"1033.1","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abu'z-Zubayr al-Makki from Jabir ibn Abdullah that the Messenger of Allah"
"1033.2","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abu'z-Zubayr al-Makki from Jabir ibn Abdullah that the Messenger of Allah"
"1034.1","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abdullah ibn Abi Bakr that Abdullah ibn Waqid said"
"1034.2","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abdullah ibn Abi Bakr that Abdullah ibn Waqid said"
"1035.1","Yahya related to me from Malik from Rabia ibn Abi Abd ar-Rahman that Abu Said alKhudri returned from a journey and his family gave him some meat. He asked whether it was meat from the sacrifice. They replied that it was. Abu Said said"
"1035.2","Yahya related to me from Malik from Rabia ibn Abi Abd ar-Rahman that Abu Said alKhudri returned from a journey and his family gave him some meat. He asked whether it was meat from the sacrifice. They replied that it was. Abu Said said"
"1036.1","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abu'z-Zubayr al-Makki that Jabir ibn Abdullah said"
"1036.2","Yahya related to me from Malik from Abu'z-Zubayr al-Makki that Jabir ibn Abdullah said"
"1037.1","Yahya related to me from Malik from Umara ibn Yasar that Ata ibn Yasar told him that Abu Ayyub al-Ansari had told him"
"1037.2","Yahya related to me from Malik from Umara ibn Yasar that Ata ibn Yasar told him that Abu Ayyub al-Ansari had told him"
"1038.1","Yahya related to me from Malik that Ibn Shihab said"
"1038.2","Yahya related to me from Malik that Ibn Shihab said"
"1039.1","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that Abdullah ibn Umar said"
"1039.2","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that Abdullah ibn Umar said"
"1040","[1040] And he told me on the authority of Malik that it had reached him that Sa`id ibn al-Musayyab used to hate for a human being to be killed, as he was killed. Concerning the game of archery and its wild animals\\nMutta Imam Malik Hadith: 1040 Arabic Hadith:"
"1041.1","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that Abdullah ibn Umar did not sacrifice for the child in the womb. Malik said"
"1041.2","Yahya related to me from Malik from Nafi that Abdullah ibn Umar did not sacrifice for the child in the womb. Malik said"
